    {
      "index": 1,
      "layout": "Title Slide",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "推理與 agent 讓 KV cache，而不是參數量，成為約束",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Raschka 2026-05-16 筆記的工程 readout",
          "shape": "Subtitle 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "layout": "Title and Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "解碼器 transformer 沒被取代，只是被改成更擅長長上下文",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "作者刻意不談資料配比、訓練課表、RL 與榜單\n本文只看 block / residual / KV / attention 的改動\n質性表現仍主要由資料與訓練配方驅動；架構改動買的是 runtime 成本",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "layout": "Section Header",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "新架構在砍三種平行成本，不是一條流水線",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "KV 記憶體",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 3"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "Attention FLOPs",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 4"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "Residual 表達力",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "layout": "Section Header",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "四種改動都掛在同一個 decoder block 上",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "Decoder block\u000bAttention + FFN",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 3"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "KV-share\u000b跨層重用 K/V",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 4"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "PLE\u000blookup 補容量",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 5"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "CCA\u000b潛空間算 attention",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 6"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "mHC\u000bn=4 residual",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "layout": "Two Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Gemma 4 用跨層 KV 重用砍 cache，把多出來的容量放進 PLE",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "家族還有 26B MoE 與 31B dense；E2B/E4B 才做跨層 KV 分享\nE2B：35 層，前 15 算 KV，後 20 重用；MQA + 滑窗 4:1\nE4B：42 層，24 算 KV，後 18 重用\n128K bf16：E2B 約省 2.7 GB，E4B 約省 6 GB（未計滑窗）",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "PLE：E2B 2.3B effective / 5.1B with embeddings\nE4B 4.5B / 8B\n額外容量在 lookup 表，不把整個 stack 做胖\n作者承認缺少對 2.3B / 5.1B 常規模型的公開對照",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "layout": "Two Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "Laguna 把 query head 花在便宜的區域層，克扣昂貴的全域層",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "40 層：30 滑窗（512）+ 10 全域\nKV head 固定 8\n全域層 6 query / KV；滑窗層 8 query / KV",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "混滑窗+全域並非新發明（Gemma 4 也用）\n新的是 per-layer query-head 預算\n先例：Apple OpenELM 2024",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "layout": "Two Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "ZAYA1 在壓縮潛空間裡做 attention，不是只壓縮 KV cache",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "MLA：壓縮 KV 再投影回 head 空間才算 attention\nCCA：Q/K/V 都壓縮，attention 直接在潛空間算完再上投影\n省 cache 也省 prefill/training FLOPs",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "壓縮後對 Q/K（不是 V）做卷積，補回區域上下文\n4:1 GQA；每 token 只啟動 1 個 routed expert\nCCA 論文自報優於 MLA——不是第三方 bake-off",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "layout": "Two Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "DeepSeek V4 沿序列軸壓縮（CSA/HCA），並用 mHC 加寬 residual",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "CSA：m=4 + 稀疏 top-k（DSA 風格）\nHCA：m'=128 再對短 cache 做 dense attention\n兩者都保留 128 token 未壓縮近窗",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "mHC：n=4 平行 residual；Res mapping 投影到雙隨機矩陣\n27B 實作 n=4 訓練時間 +6.7%；原 HC FLOPs 13.36G→13.38G/token\n相對 V3.2、1M：V4-Pro 27% FLOPs / 10% KV；V4-Flash 10% / 7%\n作者：不能說 CSA/HCA 普遍優於 MLA；沒有獨立 ablation",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "layout": "Section Header",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "CSA 保細節、HCA 保覆蓋，近窗被兩條路徑共用",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "近窗 128 token 未壓縮 KV（兩條路徑都保留）",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 3"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "CSA：m=4 + 稀疏 top-k\u000b保細節",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 4"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "HCA：m'=128 再 dense\u000b保覆蓋",
          "shape": "Rounded Rectangle 5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "layout": "Title and Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "跨層分享省的是數 GB；V4 在 1M 把 KV 壓到 V3.2 的 7–10%",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "Gemma 4 E2B\n128K bf16\n跨層分享約省 2.7 GB\n（未計滑窗）",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "layout": "Title and Content",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "role": "title",
          "text": "先做可逆的跨層 KV sharing，再考慮 CSA/HCA 等級的複雜度",
          "shape": "Title 1"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "text": "來源沒有關閉的問題：品質對成本的 ablation 仍然薄\n跨層 KV sharing 有論文與 Gemma 4 產品化，改動面比 V4 小\nCCA/CSA/HCA 更激進，也更難在我們的 stack 落地\n決策：先 prototype 跨層 KV sharing；V4 級序列壓縮列為觀察項，不作為第一個施工項",
          "shape": "Content Placeholder 2"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}